1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:05,833
The window beside you is black. Your
reflection crouches with you. But it
moves a second too late.

2
00:00:06,333 --> 00:00:11,333
Rule eight. If your reflection is
late, it isn't yours. Pull the blind
down.

3
00:00:11,833 --> 00:00:15,967
The heat comes from car seven. The
valve is stuck. I can't leave the
front.
